efore calculating their intercepts.\"},\n    {\"id\": \"t2\", \"groupId\": \"intercepts\", \"annotationIds\": [\"n1x\", \"n1y\", \"n2x\", \"n2y\"], \"narration\": \"Simplify each equation and find its x- and y-intercepts.\"},\n    {\"id\": \"t3\", \"groupId\": \"intercepts\", \"narration\": \"The lines have equal slopes and different y-intercepts. They are distinct parallel lines, so the system is inconsistent and its full solution set is ∅.\"}\n  ]\n}"
